This is the repository of the code used to generate the plots of the paper "A single-cell atlas to map sex-specific gene-expression changes in blood upon neurodegeneration".

To run the analysis and create the plots

1) For the male and female subset: 
run analysis/include_celltype_proportion.R
run analysis/correlate_clinical_measures.R 
run analysis/PrepareData_Figure2_be.R and analysis/scCODA.py
run the Snakemake pipeline

2) for ROSMAP data: 
run the Snakemake pipeline

3) run all scripts in Create_Plots


